\u002Fdb-sync","9.design\u002Fdb-sync",{"title":164,"path":224,"stem":225},"\u002Fdesign\u002Fdispatch-center","9.design\u002Fdispatch-center",{"title":227,"path":228,"stem":229},"Employee Management","\u002Fdesign\u002Femployee-management","9.design\u002Femployee-management",{"title":231,"path":232,"stem":233},"Player Tracker Rework","\u002Fdesign\u002Fplayer-tracker-rework","9.design\u002Fplayer-tracker-rework",{"title":235,"path":236,"stem":237},"Qualifications","\u002Fdesign\u002Fqualifications","9.design\u002Fqualifications",{"id":239,"title":49,"body":240,"description":246,"extension":382,"links":383,"meta":384,"navigation":385,"path":50,"redirect":383,"seo":386,"stem":51,"__hash__":387},"content_en\u002F1.getting-started\u002F4.installation\u002F2.cloud.md",{"type":241,"value":242,"toc":372},"minimark",[243,247,250,255,284,288,299,302,305,320,324,365,369],[244,245,246],"p",{},"FiveNet Cloud is available today as a managed hosting option for communities that want us to run and maintain FiveNet for them.",[244,248,249],{},"The service is hosted by ZerBytes UG (haftungsbeschrankt).",[251,252,254],"h3",{"id":253},"why-choose-fivenet-cloud","Why Choose FiveNet Cloud",[256,257,258,266,272,278],"ul",{},[259,260,261,265],"li",{},[262,263,264],"strong",{},"Managed Hosting",": We run and maintain your FiveNet instance for you.",[259,267,268,271],{},[262,269,270],{},"Less Operational Overhead",": You do not need to build and maintain your own Docker or Kubernetes setup for FiveNet.",[259,273,274,277],{},[262,275,276],{},"Ongoing Updates",": We keep your FiveNet instance up to date as new releases become available.",[259,279,280,283],{},[262,281,282],{},"Direct Support",": Cloud customers can reach out through Discord support tickets for onboarding and operational questions.",[251,285,287],{"id":286},"what-you-still-need-to-provide","What You Still Need To Provide",[256,289,290,293,296],{},[259,291,292],{},"Access to the gameserver database that FiveNet should use.",[259,294,295],{},"The required plugin integration on your gameserver.",[259,297,298],{},"Any server-specific configuration needed for your community and framework.",[244,300,301],{},"FiveNet Cloud reduces the infrastructure work on your side, but you still need to connect it to your gameserver environment.",[251,303,16],{"id":304},"getting-started",[306,307,308,311,314,317],"ol",{},[259,309,310],{},"Join the FiveNet Discord.",[259,312,313],{},"Create a support ticket for FiveNet Cloud.",[259,315,316],{},"Share the details needed for your setup, such as your community, gameserver environment, and database connectivity.",[259,318,319],{},"We will guide you through onboarding and the remaining setup steps.",[251,321,323],{"id":322},"faqs","FAQs",[325,326,329,337,344,351,358],"card-group",{"className":327},[328],"sm:grid-cols-1",[330,331,334],"card",{"icon":332,"title":333},"i-mdi-database","What happens to my data?",[244,335,336],{},"Your gameserver database must be accessible to FiveNet. If you later switch to a self-hosted instance, you can request the attachment data, such as avatars.",[330,338,341],{"icon":339,"title":340},"i-mdi-currency-usd-off","Is there a free tier?",[244,342,343],{},"Currently, there is no free tier available for FiveNet.",[330,345,348],{"icon":346,"title":347},"i-mdi-cloud-upload","How do I migrate from self-hosted to cloud?",[244,349,350],{},"No full migration is required. Since your FiveNet data, such as citizens and documents, remains tied to your database, the main extra step is handling attachment data if needed.",[330,352,355],{"icon":353,"title":354},"i-mdi-cloud-download","How do I migrate from cloud to self-hosted?",[244,356,357],{},"Since FiveNet data, such as citizens and documents, is stored in your database, you mainly need a copy of the attachment data for your self-hosted instance. The FiveNet Cloud team can assist with this process.",[330,359,362],{"icon":360,"title":361},"i-mdi-tools","Do I still need technical setup on my side?",[244,363,364],{},"Yes. FiveNet Cloud removes most of the infrastructure work, but you still need to provide database access and complete the required plugin integration for your gameserver.",[251,366,368],{"id":367},"next-step","Next Step",[244,370,371],{},"Join the FiveNet Discord and create a cloud support ticket to get started with FiveNet Cloud. Our team can help with onboarding, setup questions, and migration planning.",{"title":373,"searchDepth":374,"depth":374,"links":375},"",2,[376,378,379,380,381],{"id":253,"depth":377,"text":254},3,{"id":286,"depth":377,"text":287},{"id":304,"depth":377,"text":16},{"id":322,"depth":377,"text":323},{"id":367,"depth":377,"text":368},"md",null,{},true,{"title":49,"description":246},"M84Q8MCY-jjvqNEWXcEl1kSYvi5-yQioBd4sxSzDUHY",1795771216479,"2f786887-f4c4-4b38-ac40-60a8b34bc36c"]